REGARDING THE LICENSE
------------------------------------------------------------------

kemacs is a derivative work of MicroEMACS 3.8i.  In the context of
kemacs, the term "current author" (as referenced in the original
copyright notice) is interpreted as Daniel M. Lawrence (deceased
2010) and Takanori (sanewo) Saneto, as stated in the kemacs WhatsNew
document.

All contributors listed above distribute their code under the same
non-commercial licensing terms.  Commercial use, incorporation into
commercial software, or resale requires the prior written permission
of all copyright holders.

